# Project config only — never credentials.
#
# This maps the @kira-joo scope to GitHub Packages so a fresh clone resolves
# the shared toolkits without per-developer setup. Authentication is
# deliberately NOT here: an auth line in a tracked file either leaks a secret
# or (as it previously did) shadows the working credential in ~/.npmrc with an
# unexpandable ${VAR} and fails every install with a 401.
#
# Local development: put //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=<token> in ~/.npmrc.
# CI: use actions/setup-node with NODE_AUTH_TOKEN, or append the auth line to
# a runner-local npmrc at job setup. Do not reintroduce it below.
@kira-joo:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
